  - 1977–1987 (post-Spielberg, pre-Communion)
  - 1987–1993 (post-Communion, pre-X-Files)
  - 1993–2004 (X-Files era)
  - 2004–present (YouTube/social media era)
Existing supporting data: GREY-005, GREY-007, GREY-008 (Session 001)
