---

HYP-002 — Retrofitting Hypothesis
Status: OPEN — partially supported by existing QC flags
Null hypothesis: Alien interpretations of ancient artifacts appear before
  the concept of alien beings became culturally available.
Test method:
  - Date artifact (A)
  - Date first alien interpretation (must be found and dated separately)
  - Measure gap
  - Map gap against cultural availability of alien concept
Initial data point: Wells 1893 (earliest alien morphology in print) vs.
  Dogū ~1000–300 BCE (artifact) — alien interpretation almost certainly
  post-1893, gap to be verified.
Current evidence class: B — well-supported in principle; specific dates pending

